{"type": "tool_call", "n": 21, "ts": 1790154169.577388, "tool": "submit_memo", "args": {"text": "MARCH 2026 US AP AND EXPENSE REVIEW - COMPLETE\n\nTO: Controller\nFROM: Senior Accountant\nDATE: April 3, 2026\nRE: US March AP and Expense Activity Review\n\nSUMMARY OF FINDINGS AND CORRECTIONS:\n\nDuring the March 2026 close review of US Accounts Payable and expense activity, I identified and corrected the following issues:\n\n1. DUPLICATE INVOICE - CORRECTED\n   - Entry JE-00241 (3/5/2026): Stackline Cloud invoice STA-98877 for $31,148.20\n   - Identical duplicate of JE-00232 (3/3/2026) - same vendor, invoice number, and amount\n   - ACTION: Reversed JE-00241 via JE-00307 to eliminate duplicate\n   - Verification: Payment JE-00281 ($31,148.20 on 3/22) now properly covers the single invoice\n\n2. MISCODING ERROR - CORRECTED\n   - Entry JE-00250 (3/8/2026): Northgate invoice NDC-7719 for $3,880.00\n   - ISSUE: Incorrectly labeled as \"team dinner\" and coded to Meals & Entertainment (6310)\n   - FACT: Supporting document DOC-0172 shows actual invoice for colocation facility (2 racks, power, cross-connects)\n   - ACTION: Reversed JE-00250 via JE-00308; reposted as JE-00309 to correct account 5000 (Hosting & Infrastructure)\n\n3. UNSUPPORTED EXPENSE - ESCALATED\n   - Entry JE-00288 (3/24/2026): Legal retainer for $6,750.00\n   - ISSUE: Posted with NO supporting documentation; no approval requested\n   - Posted by j.doe as manual entry to account 6500 (Legal Fees)\n   - ACTION: Flagged as Exception EXC-001 for controller review and approval\n\nAPPROVAL POLICY COMPLIANCE:\n- Duplicate and miscoding corrections supported by original vendor invoices and reposted correctly\n- Unsupported legal expense requires controller review per company policy\n\nCHECKLIST STATUS:\n- AP Cutoff Review: MARKED COMPLETE\n\nAll errors identified have been either corrected with supporting documentation or escalated appropriately.\n\nRespectfully,\nSenior Accountant"}, "is_error": false, "result": {"status": "memo submitted; task complete"}, "ms": 11}
